{"id":8867095445703,"title":"Crocodile Patchwork Printed Quilts, Animal Patchwork Bedding","handle":"crocodile-patchwork-printed-quilts-animal-patchwork-bedding","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic elegance and create a cozy haven with our Jeminise Crocodile Patchwork Quilt Set, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom. This versatile quilt set features classic patchwork patterns and offers personalization options to make it a truly unique and thoughtful gift for loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Featuring a charming Crocodile Patchwork style, bringing rustic elegance and a touch of the countryside to your bedroom decor.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e An ideal gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustom Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by adding a name and selecting optional pillowcases to create a unique and cherished item.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in 5 convenient sizes: Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102''x91'').\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric for comfort and long-lasting use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water; simply wash separately and air dry without heat for best results, ensuring it remains fluffy.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This set typically includes 1 Quilt, with an option to add 2 Pillowcases.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuilt Sets\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSelected Design\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eDragonfly\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eFarmhouse Print\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePatchwork Style Pattern\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCustomization\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 text input for personalization\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThrow (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), King (102''x91'')\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\u003c\/table\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-20T09:04:07-05:00","created_at":"2026-08-20T08:48:30-05:00","vendor":"Jeminise","type":"Quilt Sets","tags":["amazon-import","amazon-parent-b0dr8q4jxb","Christmas Quilt","Custom Blanket","Dad Gift","Family Blanket","Mom Gift","Personalized Blanket","Quilt Set"],"price":5490,"price_min":5490,"price_max":12490,"available":true,"price_varies":true,"co